    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SPM401 · Assessment 3/5</span>\n<h2>Midterm Progress Test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 11202 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SPM401 · Đầu điểm 3/5</span>\n<h2>Midterm Progress Test</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 11202 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">10.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: 30'-40'; Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: Multiple choices; Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">Option 1: 20-25; Option 2 (For Constructivism Approach only): Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">cover Lectures 1-5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">in class, by instructor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">Instruction and schedules for Progress Test must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus.<br><br>The test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material.<br><br>Instructor has responsibility to review the test for students after graded.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 35 — Review for Midterm</li><li>Session 36 — Review for Midterm</li><li>Session 48 — Lecture 8. Review and Discussion: Planning for Contingencies</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 35 — Review for Midterm</li><li>Buổi 36 — Review for Midterm</li><li>Buổi 48 — Lecture 8. Review and Discussion: Planning for Contingencies</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=SPM401\">Exam Room — SPM401</a> (4 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=SPM401\">Phòng thi — SPM401</a> (4 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
